# Check out text files with LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, Git's core.autocrlf=true (the default on Windows, including the
# GitHub Windows runners) rewrites every file to CRLF on checkout. oxfmt writes
# and expects LF and has no "auto" mode, so the format check then fails on all
# files on Windows while passing on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binaries, whatever the content sniffing thinks.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.node binary
*.tgz binary
